// The same program again, but supplying a quantum witness expression, to see
// whether forget takes a non-qfree witness H(0).  If it does, the drop is
// expressible with a programmer-supplied discharge; if it does not, the parked
// state |+> has no spelling at all, a witness having to be a basis value.
def main(){
	t := H(0:𝔹);
	forget(t=H(0:𝔹));
	return 0:𝔹;
}
